<article class="ltx_document" lang="en">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text"><span id="id1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">PyVision</span> </span>-RL: Forging Open Agentic Vision Models via RL</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
