<span id="S3.T1.8.1.1.1.1.1.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r">Mini-o3 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">Lai et al., 2025</a>)</cite></span>
<span id="S3.T1.8.1.1.1.1.1.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.T1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="88.2^{\dagger}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mn>88.2</mn><mo>†</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">88.2^{\dagger}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span id="S3.T1.8.1.1.1.1.1.1.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">77.5</span>
